        "@value": "Members of Parliament (Remuneration) (Amendment) (No. 2) Bill 2001"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Members of Parliament (Remuneration) (Amendment) (No. 2) Act 2001."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act shall be deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2001. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Members of Parliament (Remuneration) Act 1980 [Act 237], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in section 2 by substituting for the definition of \"Member\" the following definition: \"Member\" means a Member of the Administration, a Member of Parliament, the President and Deputy President of the Senate and the Speaker and Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives;'. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 4 of the principal Act is amended —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraphs (a) and (b), by substituting for the words \"ten thousand two hundred and eighty five\" the words \"eleven thousand five hundred and seventy two\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraphs (c) and (d), by substituting for the words \"a monthly allowance of three thousand three hundred and ninety nine ringgit\" the words \"a monthly salary of eight thousand ringgit\". Payment of salaries notwithstanding section 7"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding section 7 of the principal Act, the monthly salaries specified in the amendments to the principal Act in section 4, and payable, shall commence from 1 January 2001 or from the date of appointment or election, whichever is the later, of the President or Deputy President of the Senate or the Speaker or Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives, as the case may be. Amendment of Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/28/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Second Schedule to the principal Act is amended in Column II by inserting after the words \"Member of Parliament\" the words \", Deputy President of the Senate and Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
